---
description: Game configurations bind through ConfigurationInstaller, never Resources
alwaysApply: true
---

# Configurations go through Zenject

Do not put gameplay configuration ScriptableObjects in a `Resources` folder, and do not `Resources.Load` them.

Place the asset under the module `GameResources/Configurations/` folder, mark it Addressable in the `Configurations` group, and bind it in `ConfigurationInstaller` with `BindConfigurationFromAddressables`. Runtime code receives the config through Zenject inject or constructor.

Catalogs of prefabs (`ItemViewCatalog`, `EngineCatalog`, `ShipStationCatalog`) are not this rule.

```csharp
// BAD
Container.Bind<ShipRunConfig>().FromMethod(() => Resources.Load<ShipRunConfig>("ShipRunConfig"));

// GOOD — ConfigurationInstaller
Container.BindConfigurationFromAddressables<ShipRunConfig>(Address.Configurations.ShipRunConfig_Default)
    .AsSingle();

public ShipRunService(ShipRunConfig config) { }
```
